{"data":[{"type":"appStoreVersionLocalizations","id":"ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc","attributes":{"locale":"en-US","description":"TimerBar is a minimal, beautiful clock with a live progress bar. It is perfect for presentations, meetings, focus sessions, and any timed workflow.\n\nFeatures:\n- Set a timer by duration or end time\n- Fullscreen clock with an elegant progress bar\n- Quick start, pause, restart, and stop controls\n- Optional remaining-time display\n- Always-on display support\n- TimerBar+ customization with premium themes, fonts, and colors\n\nStay focused and stay in control with TimerBar.\n\nTerms of Use: https://asdftq.github.io/timerbar/terms.html","keywords":"timer,clock,progress,presentation,meeting,focus,track,time,bar,countdown,customizable,duration","marketingUrl":"https://asdftq.github.io/timerbar/","supportUrl":"https://asdftq.github.io/timerbar/support.html","whatsNew":"Updated for iPhone Duo with the latest iOS SDK. TimerBar adapts to the changing display while keeping your timer, saved presets, and clock preferences."},"relationships":{"appScreenshotSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc/relationships/appScreenshotSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc/appScreenshotSets"}},"appPreviewSets":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc/relationships/appPreviewSets","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc/appPreviewSets"}},"searchKeywords":{"links":{"self":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc/relationships/searchKeywords","related":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/appStoreVersionLocalizations/ab459c95-68af-42d6-85b0-6ce39903cadc